        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Adytum provides a true application background management for modern jailbroken devices (iOS15.0-iOS17.x).",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
          "itemCornerRadius": 12,
          "itemSize": "{160, 346}",
          "screenshots": [
            {
              "accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1",
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kernelrw/kernelrw.github.io/main/SileoDepiction/Adytum/Screenshot_01.png"
            },
            {
              "accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2",
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kernelrw/kernelrw.github.io/main/SileoDepiction/Adytum/Screenshot_02.png"
            },
            {
              "accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3",
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kernelrw/kernelrw.github.io/main/SileoDepiction/Adytum/Screenshot_03.png"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Adytum features four backgrounding modes which you can assign either from 3D Touch/Haptic Touch context menu or from within tweak settings page as app selections .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Backgrounding Modes",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Termination mode",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Prevents iOS from ever closing your protected apps even under memory pressure ; (use this feature with caution , enabling many apps randomly may run your device out of memory - sever system lag).",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Suspension mode",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Enabled apps behave as if they are running in the foreground (apps are never suspended ). Perfect for files uploads downloads - listening to music or whatever purpose you wish . Credits to SergeAlagon for his amazing tweak Immortalizer .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionTableButtonView",
          "title": "Credits: SergeAlagon (Immortalizer)",
          "action": "https://x.com/srgndrlgn?s=21",
          "openExternal": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Fast Freeze mode",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Instantly freezing your apps the moment they leave the foreground and return to them whenever you want to the point you left without reloading . You have a slider of 10 seconds period inside tweak settings to control FF delay .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Combined PT+FF mode",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Freezes enabled apps instantly & put them instantly in memory as a prevented terminate apps .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Other Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "WhatsApp Notifications Fix",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Since we are hooking runnigboardd , implementing WhatsApp Service Extension memory expansion is here . You have a toggle inside tweak settings to enable or disable this feature . If happened this feature is not working correctly , make sure to target WhatsApp with FF or PS mode (Fast Freeze mode preferably).  Credits to 0xkuj for FixWANotifs tweak .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionTableButtonView",
          "title": "Credits: 0xKuj (FixWANotifs)",
          "action": "https://x.com/0xkuj?s=21",
          "openExternal": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Toast Notification Banner",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Changing any state for any app from 3D touch context menu will fire a nice toast banner containing the activated state and app name .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Global System Bypass",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "If you encounter issues (strange behavior ) for any app , this feature is here to exclude the targeted app from the 4 protection modes .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Profile Backup",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "As an action inside tweak settings to export and import the entire configurations for all of your protected apps with all those 4 protection modes and restore them any time later ( for those who restore rootfs frequently ).",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Purging",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Safely purge unmanaged backgrounded apps from within tweak settings to apply new modes without a Respring .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Action Logging",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "If enabled , will record all backgrounding events for the 4 protection modes & global bypasses .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Known Issues ( unsolvable issues )",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Facebook",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "v561+ may launch to a black screen when applying \"Prevent Termination\" for the first time. Resetting app data or reinstalling the app will solve this issue forever .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "WhatsApp",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Targeting WhatsApp with  \"Prevent Termination\" or the \"combined mode\" will make the app flushing into a black screen only in case returning to the app from a Prevented Termination state and other protected apps are in the AppSwitcher . Targeting WhatsApp with other modes is safe and works fine  .",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
